        "original_id": "67218547-1ecf-5bc2-b0bf-d6da88f86811",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: John DiMaggio, C. H. Greenblatt, Billy West, Tara Strong, Tom Kenny, Grey DeLisle, June Foray, Rachael MacFarlane, Mark Hamill, Ed Asner, Robin Atkin Downes, Pamela Adlon\n- TV series: Kim Possible, Teen Titans, The Penguins of Madagascar, Pound Puppies, Samurai Jack, Chowder, Futurama, Adventure Time\n- Film: I Know That Voice\n- Networks: Cartoon Network\n- Characters: Dr. Drakken, Motor Ed, Brother Blood, Aquaman, Rico, Ogre, Niblet, Scotsman, Shnitzel, Bender, Jake\n\nFacts:\n- Chowder is an American animated television series created by C. H. Greenblatt for Cartoon Network.\n- John DiMaggio voiced Dr. Drakken and Motor Ed on Kim Possible.\n- John DiMaggio voiced Brother Blood on Teen Titans.\n- John DiMaggio voiced Rico in The Penguins of Madagascar.\n- John DiMaggio voiced Niblet on Pound Puppies.\n- John DiMaggio voiced the Scotsman on Samurai Jack.\n- John DiMaggio voiced Shnitzel on Chowder.\n- I Know That Voice is narrated by John DiMaggio.\n- John DiMaggio is the voice of Bender on Futurama and Jake on Adventure Time.\n- I Know That Voice stars John DiMaggio and other voice actors including Billy West, Tara Strong, Tom Kenny, Grey DeLisle, June Foray, Rachael MacFarlane, Mark Hamill, Ed Asner, Robin Atkin Downes, and Pamela Adlon.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
